  "_about": "Where every movable thing sits, on each side of the toggle (film, performance) and in each of the desktop layout and the phone layout. zone: 'hero' puts it on the hero's desk (x, y in % of the hero), 'page' anywhere below the hero (x in % of the page width, y in % of the main column). A window of the page itself (win-…) keeps its place in the flow and is nudged from it: x in % of the column's width, y in px. hide: true leaves it out of that layout. A thing with no entry on the performance side sits where the film side puts it; with no entry anywhere it stays where the markup puts it. Edited at /admin, which saves this file out."
}
